  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/66c2bd65-5b88-44e1-b4e7-cd5bb2d10b94-9895420.PNG\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 216px;\" /></p><p>In region I, due to charge at centre, electric field will be present.</p><p>But in region II, electric field will be zero as electric field inside material of conductor is zero.</p><p>Again for outside region, net charges enclosed is not zero and therefore electric field will exist.</p>",
